<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For I have set Jesus forever before me:</l><l>He’s at my right hand.</l><l>For I have set Jesus forever before me:</l><l>He’s at my right hand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Therefore is my heart glad, My spirit rejoiceth,</l><l>My flesh rests in hope.</l><l>Therefore is my heart glad, My spirit rejoiceth,</l><l>My flesh rests in hope.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
